# --- regenerable stimulus output ---------------------------------------------
# QC wavs written by protocols/dev/stimulus_check.py (cells 2 and 3). Every one
# of these is a fresh random draw, so committing them is meaningless — rerun the
# cell instead. The stimulus itself is defined by
# localization_helpers/stimulus.py and each trial's exact spectrum is stored in
# sequence.stim_params, so nothing is lost.
/hrtf_relearning/data/sounds/stimulus_check/

